\pard\b\f0\fs24 Sherpa Rifle\b0\f1\fs18\par
\par
\b\f0 Round capacity:\b0\f1  Magazine-fed; exact capacity not stated.\par
\b\f0 Role in Story:\b0\f1  Standard Protectant rifle for John's team, especially during cold-weather and mountain deployments.\par
\b\f0 Proficient Characters:\b0\f1  John Walker, Tex Kovachnikov, Tao Vang, Shai Siante.\par
\b\f0 Season:\b0\f1  Chapters 1-4.\par
\b\f0 Unique Features:\b0\f1  Sherpa cold-weather configuration, integrated thermal core, reversible cooling cycle, and strong resistance to condensation or cold-weather jamming.\par
\b\f0 Description:\b0\f1  The Sherpa configuration is a Protectant rifle tuned for extreme environments. In the Himalayas John uses reverse thermal mode to melt through ice and reveal the buried facility, and the platform remains the squad's dependable long gun even after the Mark IV introduces more autonomous fire support.\par
\b\f0 Sights:\b0\f1  Amber and red HUD icons, blue flame when reverse thermal mode is engaged, and a clean lattice stock.\par
\b\f0 Sounds:\b0\f1  Mechanical click, cooling-cycle hiss and the crack of a live weapon in thin air.\par
\b\f0 Smell:\b0\f1  Steam, hot metal and burnt frost.\par
\b\f0 Notes:\b0\f1  The manuscript also treats the rifle as an extension of John's field habits: familiar, maintained and trusted.\par
\b\f0 Built at:\b0\f1  Protectant arsenal.\par
